            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagwireku abakulembeze abo abasansaania abantu ba Musengwa Katonda ni babazikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli bino by'akoba ebigema ku bakulembeze abalabirira abantu be, ati: “Imwe timwafaayo naire kulabirira bantu bange. Mwababinga era mwabasansaania. Aye bona eno, nze ndidha kufaayo inho okubona nga imwe mbabonereza olw'ebibi bye mwakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze mwene ndidha kusoloza abantu bange abaliwonagho nga mbatoola mu nsi dhoonadhoona ye nababingira, mbaize mu nsi yaibwe. Balizaalagana baaba kamaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibateeragho abakulembeze okubalabiriranga, abantu bange abo baalekera agho okutya n'okweraliikirira, era ghaaloba kubaagho waire omulala ati abula. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
