    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze ndi Katonda aba buli ghantu, se ti mu kifo kirala kyonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mag 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SIR.16.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sir 16:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ghazira muntu asobola kwegisa ghe ntasobola kumubona. Timwidhi nga ndi buli ghantu, mu igulu ni mu nsi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidhi abalanzi abo bye bakoba, abalanga eby'obuguya mu liina lyange, nga bakoba mbu nze nabagha obukwenda bwange nga bali mu birooto byaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalanzi abo balikomya li okudaaliimya abantu bange, nga babakobera eby'obuguya bye bayiiya obuyiiye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balowooza bati ebirooto byaibwe bye bakobera abantu, binaaleetera abantu bange abo okuneerabira, ng'oti ni badhaadha baibwe bwe baaneerabira ni baira mu kusinza omusambwa Baali? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulanzi aloose ekirooto agwaine akobe ati ekyo kirooto bulooto. Ate omulanzi afunie obukwenda okuva ye ndi agwaine alangirire obukwenda obwo n'obwesigwa. Omusiisi guba mulungi ng'engaano yeene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukwenda bwange buli oti muliro, era bwaba ng'oti n'enhundo ekonta amabaale ni gafuuka obumulumulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni nkyagha abalanzi abo abatoola ebibono okuva ku banaibwe, memale ni babirangirira ng'obukwenda obuva ye ndi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nkyagha n'abalanzi abo abatoola ebibono ebyaibwe ku bwaibwe, ni babikobera abantu bati, ‘Musengwa Katonda atyo bw'akoba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwulire nze Musengwa Katonda kye nkoba: Nkyagha abalanzi abo abakobera abantu ebirooto byaibwe ebiidhwire obuguya, ni badaaliimya abantu bange n'obuguya bwaibwe obwo, nga babeesuutiraku. Tibatumangaku, naire okubalagira baje bakole batyo! Era bazira kya makulu kye batwalira bantu abo naire. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: “Yeremia, omuntu yeenayeena, oba omulanzi, oba kabona, bw'aidhanga n'akubuuza ati, ‘Bukwenda ki obuva ye Musengwa?’ Iwe omwirangamu oti, ‘Niiwe omugugu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:33:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "omugugu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Luheburayi ekibono ekitegeeza “Obukwenda” era n'ekirala ekyo ekitegeeza “Omugugu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omuzito eri Musengwa Katonda, era Musengwa Katonda oyo akoba ati aidha kukusuula ere.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulanzi, oba kabona, oba omuntu owundi yeenayeena alikoba ati, ‘Omugugu gwa Musengwa Katonda,’ ndimubonereza mwene n'ab'omu maka ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye buli muntu aidha kubuuzanga bakagwa be oba aboluganda lwe ati, ‘Musengwa Katonda aizemu atya? Musengwa Katonda akobye ki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni batakozesanga bibono ebyo, ‘Omugugu gwa Musengwa Katonda,’ kuba oyo alibikozesa yeenayeena, nja kufuula obukwenda bwange bube omugugu gwene omuzito eri omuntu oyo. Abantu bafuulaniafuulania ebibono byange nze Musengwa Katonda waibwe, Afuga amagye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Yeremia, oidha kubuuzanga abalanzi oti, ‘Musengwa Katonda akwizeemu atya? Musengwa Katonda akobye ki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe badheemera ekiragiro kyange ni bakozesa ebibono bino, ‘Omugugu gwa Musengwa Katonda,’ olwo oidha kubakobanga oti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nze Musengwa Katonda nja kubabbeeda mbasuule ere banve mu maiso. Ndidha kubasuula ere, beene ghalala n'ekibuga kyaibwe kye nabagha era kye nagha ni badhaadha baibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ndidha kubaleetera ensoni okubagemanga, abantu babanhoomenga aghazira kwerabira naire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
